          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">agent tools vs sub-agents:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>agent tools: Agent A uses Agent B as a <em>tool</em></li>\n<li>sub-agent: Agent A transfers control to Agent B\ncompletely, so it's  hand-off to something like a\nspecialist.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ecfG",
      "code_hash": "3030d301896abdd190c2f5f0b4672bc2",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"part-2\">Part 2</h3>\n<h4 id=\"agent-tool-patterns-and-best-practices\">Agent tool patterns and best practices</h4>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We'll do the following:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>connect to external MCP servers</li>\n<li>Implement long-running operations</li>\n<li>Build resumable workflows</li>\n<li>Understand when and how to use these patterns</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
